@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home - ClaimsIQ Platform</PageTitle>

<div class="page-header">
    <h3>🏥 Azure HealthCare Intelligence Platform</h3>
    <p class="subtitle">Enterprise Healthcare Claims Processing with FHIR R4 Compliance & AI-Powered Fraud Detection</p>
</div>

<div style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
    <h4 style="color: #0078d4; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Welcome to the Claims Management Platform</h4>
    
    <p style="line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        This portal provides comprehensive healthcare claims management capabilities inspired by industry-leading 
        systems like Trizetto Facets, with full FHIR R4 schema compliance and natural language assistance powered by AI.
    </p>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem;">
        <div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #0078d4;">
            <h5 style="color: #0078d4; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🏥 Benefits Configuration</h5>
            <p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                Configure and manage benefit plans including PPO, HMO, EPO, and Catastrophic coverage. 
                View deductibles, coinsurance rates, copays, and covered services with real-time FHIR mapping.
            </p>
            <a href="/benefits" style="color: #0078d4; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">
                Manage Benefits →
            </a>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #107c10;">
            <h5 style="color: #107c10; margin-bottom: 1rem;">⚙️ Claims Engine</h5>
            <p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                Real-time claims adjudication with 4-step validation: coverage check, network validation, 
                deductible/coinsurance calculation, and out-of-pocket maximum enforcement.
            </p>
            <a href="/claims-engine" style="color: #107c10; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">
                Validate Claims →
            </a>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #7b1fa2;">
            <h5 style="color: #7b1fa2; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🔍 Eligibility Verification</h5>
            <p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                270/271 HIPAA-compliant eligibility checks. Real-time verification of patient coverage, 
                deductible status, and out-of-pocket spending with FHIR CoverageEligibilityResponse.
            </p>
            <a href="/eligibility" style="color: #7b1fa2; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">
                Check Eligibility →
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f4fd 0%, #ffffff 100%); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 2rem; border: 2px solid #0078d4;">
        <h5 style="color: #0078d4; margin-bottom: 1rem;">💬 Natural Language AI Assistant</h5>
        <p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;">
            Each module includes an AI-powered assistant that answers questions about benefit configuration, 
            claims processing, eligibility rules, CPT codes, and FHIR mappings in plain English. Just type your 
            question to get instant guidance on complex healthcare concepts.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f3f2f1; border-radius: 8px;">
        <h5 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">📊 Key Features</h5>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
            <li><strong>FHIR R4 Compliant:</strong> All data structures map to FHIR resources (Coverage, Claim, ClaimResponse, CoverageEligibilityResponse)</li>
            <li><strong>Natural Language Help:</strong> Context-aware AI assistant for product configuration and questions</li>
            <li><strong>Real-time Validation:</strong> Instant claim adjudication with detailed error/warning messages</li>
            <li><strong>Benefit Management:</strong> Multi-plan support with PPO/HMO/EPO configurations</li>
            <li><strong>Progress Tracking:</strong> Visual deductible and out-of-pocket maximum tracking</li>
            <li><strong>Industry Standards:</strong> CPT codes, ICD-10, X12 EDI concepts integrated</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
